###

POST {{ClockIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}/attendance/clock-out
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{ClockIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}/attendance/missing-clock-out
Accept: application/json
